%% Source: uml/U3-sequence-diagrams.md - U3.10 Circuit breaker around a provider
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Service
    participant CB as Circuit breaker
    participant P as Provider

    S->>CB: call
    CB->>P: forward (closed)
    P--xCB: timeout
    CB->>CB: failures = threshold, state = open
    S->>CB: call
    CB-->>S: fail fast (open)
    Note over CB: after cool-down state = half-open
    S->>CB: call
    CB->>P: trial request
    P-->>CB: ok
    CB->>CB: state = closed
    CB-->>S: result
